# Camera-Based RGBWW Optimizer

Camera-based calibration and optimization tooling for RGBWW lighting.

Read `docs/README.md` for current setup, package commands, measurement workflow,
and calibration strategy.

## Remote camera controller

`remote_camera_controller/` 保存 Canon EOS R6 Mark III Raspberry Pi bridge 的源码、离线测试和自包含文档。它提供同步 RAW capture 与 best-effort gphoto2 时序 metadata；不会把 estimate 宣称为绝对 exposure-start，也不改变 P7/TD-A 门禁。

入口：[remote_camera_controller/README.md](remote_camera_controller/README.md)
